# Git workflow

- Never commit or push to `main`. Never force-push `main`.
- Create or reuse a GitHub issue first (`gh issue create` or an existing issue).
- Branch as `feat/#n-slug` or `fix/#n-slug` (`chore` is ok for this bootstrap).
- Open a PR with `Fixes #n` in the body.
- Wait for Quality CI (`test`, `tsc`, `lint`, `build`) to be green.
- Do NOT wait for Bugbot / Cursor Bugbot — it is not part of this workflow.
- Do not merge until the user says so.
- Tag `v*` only after an explicit Go. Desktop-CI stays tag-only.
- Do not commit secrets, `.tmp` screenshots, or `.env`.
